{"reviewId": "362346758_88kAS1cV2", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "这是我问豆包得到的回答：2026年（当前）正处于：第五轮康波周期（信息技术）萧条期的末尾，第六轮康波周期（AI+新能源）回升期（复苏期）的起点。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "362346758_88kAS1cV2", "userVid": 362346758, "topics": [], "createTime": 1776063545, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 362346758, "name": "Aurelia", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/7iaV3auauPvMMKzeZ1pttG52MOJTTxVHb24FGzBxv2RjUH0MWzvLv8jSuV1D95iaOwDJ600IM11SXib2OSqKA7piafX6wctCY3FqlJTbTjcib13A/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "回升期的底部是不是还要15年 ", "reviewId": "362346758_88kAS1cV2", "commentId": "362346758_88kAS1cV2_c219879188_88mcCrXvz", "userVid": 219879188, "createTime": 1776154929, "author": {"userVid": 219879188, "name": "🦐Lucky Freja🐰", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/JcDicrZBlREjxf07oD5gI34TVc6yeYy0STSiauQC12npFGJcBtLK6icKg/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "🦐Lucky Freja🐰", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "des